This file implements the dihedral "seed" structure on the Brockian 5-cycle, including the embedding of ZMod 5 into ℂ via 5th roots of unity, the rotation operation, and the reflection operation (complex conjugation). It proves key properties such as the rotation isometry, the involutive nature of reflection, and that reflection preserves distances between embedded points.
